OL,3,GNEWSAPilot crashed and died after
OL,4,Amental health battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pilot most likely crashed into a
OL,7,Freservoir on purpose after suffering
OL,8,Fwith his mental health, investigators
OL,9,Fhave concluded.
OL,11,FPeter Beeson, 66, from Bishop's
OL,12,FStortford in Hertfordshire, was killed
OL,13,Finstantly when his Beagle B121 Pup
OL,14,Faeroplane hit the water.
OL,16,FIt happened at Hanningfield Reservoir,
OL,17,Fnear Chelmsford, at about 14:00 GMT on
OL,18,F28 December.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
