OL,3,GNEWSAPilot crashed and died after
OL,4,Amental health battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeeson had told a friend he felt
OL,7,F"rubbish and unhappy" in the days
OL,8,Fbefore his death, the Air Accidents
OL,9,FInvestigation Branch (AAIB) said in a
OL,10,Freport.
